{
  "conversation_lines": [
    {
      "turn_number": 1,
      "time": "2172-09-12 20:15:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Hi, I’m Dr. Lee. I understand you came in after talking about a difficult moment during your ECT appointment. Can you tell me what happened?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 2,
      "time": "2172-09-12 20:17:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yeah… yesterday I was driving to get coffee. Out of nowhere, I just felt this urge to end it. I pressed the gas all the way down and left it for about a minute."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 3,
      "time": "2172-09-12 20:18:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That sounds really overwhelming. Did you think about crashing the car?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 4,
      "time": "2172-09-12 20:19:45",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I thought about it… but I didn’t turn the wheel. I just let go of the gas and kept driving. I don’t know why I didn’t do it. I didn’t want to die, but I didn’t care if I lived either."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 5,
      "time": "2172-09-12 20:21:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Thank you for sharing that. It takes courage. You’re not alone in this. We’re going to keep you safe here while we figure out the next steps."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 6,
      "time": "2172-09-12 20:22:15",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I just feel like everyone would be better off without me. My mom, my boyfriend, my brother… I’m a burden."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 7,
      "time": "2172-09-12 20:23:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "I hear that pain. But your life matters. We’re going to work on helping you feel that again. For now, we’ll have someone check in with you regularly to make sure you’re safe."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 8,
      "time": "2172-09-13 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good morning. How did you sleep?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 9,
      "time": "2172-09-13 09:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Not great. I kept thinking about my baby. I’m scared I’m not a good mom."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 10,
      "time": "2172-09-13 09:03:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Being a new mom is hard, especially with everything else you’re managing. You’ve been through a lot—bipolar disorder, chronic pain, endometriosis. That’s not easy."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 11,
      "time": "2172-09-13 09:04:45",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "It’s exhausting. And I used to take ECT weekly. It helped, but I’ve missed a few sessions because of everything."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 12,
      "time": "2172-09-13 09:06:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re going to restart ECT while you’re here. It’s often very effective for treatment-resistant depression. We’ve scheduled your first session for Thursday."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 13,
      "time": "2172-09-13 09:07:15",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay… I’m nervous. Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 14,
      "time": "2172-09-13 09:08:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re asleep during the treatment, so you don’t feel anything. Some people have a headache or muscle soreness afterward, but we’ll manage that."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 15,
      "time": "2172-09-13 09:09:45",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay… if it helps, I’ll try."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 16,
      "time": "2172-09-14 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Just checking in. How are you feeling today?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 17,
      "time": "2172-09-14 10:01:15",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Still tired. My stomach hurts—probably from the endometriosis. And I’ve been heartburn a lot."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 18,
      "time": "2172-09-14 10:02:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We can adjust your meds for the reflux. And we’ll keep monitoring your pain. You’re on thyroid medication too, right?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 19,
      "time": "2172-09-14 10:03:45",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Yes, levothyroxine. I take it every morning."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 20,
      "time": "2172-09-14 10:05:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good. We’ll make sure that continues. Your labs look stable, so no changes needed there."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 21,
      "time": "2172-09-15 13:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "How are you feeling after your first ECT session?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 22,
      "time": "2172-09-15 13:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Tired. My head hurts a little, and I feel confused. Did I say anything weird?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 23,
      "time": "2172-09-15 13:03:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That’s normal. Some short-term confusion and headache are common. You didn’t say anything unusual. You’re doing great."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 24,
      "time": "2172-09-15 13:04:45",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I don’t remember much after they put the mask on. Is that bad?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 25,
      "time": "2172-09-15 13:06:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "No, that’s expected. Most people don’t remember the procedure. We’ll keep monitoring your memory, but this is typical."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 26,
      "time": "2172-09-16 09:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your mood seems a bit brighter today. How are you feeling?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 27,
      "time": "2172-09-16 09:31:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I don’t know… maybe a little less heavy? I still feel guilty about being a burden."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 28,
      "time": "2172-09-16 09:33:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That guilt is part of the illness. You’re not a burden. We’re here to support you, not because you’re failing, but because you’re fighting."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 29,
      "time": "2172-09-16 09:34:15",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you… that helps to hear."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 30,
      "time": "2172-09-17 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re planning your next ECT for Monday. How’s the headache been?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 31,
      "time": "2172-09-17 10:01:15",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Better. Just a dull ache now. I’m scared of losing more memories though."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 32,
      "time": "2172-09-17 10:02:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re using bilateral stimulation, which is effective but can affect memory. We’ll keep the dose as low as possible to help protect that."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 33,
      "time": "2172-09-17 10:03:45",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay… I just don’t want to forget my baby’s first year."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 34,
      "time": "2172-09-17 10:05:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That’s completely understandable. We’ll document your concerns and review them with the team."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 35,
      "time": "2172-09-18 13:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "How are you feeling after today’s ECT?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 36,
      "time": "2172-09-18 13:02:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Less confused than last time. I think I’m starting to adjust."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 37,
      "time": "2172-09-18 13:03:15",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That’s a good sign. Your mood is improving too. You smiled at the nurse today—small things matter."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 38,
      "time": "2172-09-18 13:04:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I didn’t even notice. Maybe I’m not completely numb anymore."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 39,
      "time": "2172-09-19 09:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re thinking ahead to discharge. How do you feel about going home?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 40,
      "time": "2172-09-19 09:01:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’m scared. What if I have another episode like the driving one?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 41,
      "time": "2172-09-19 09:02:45",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That’s valid. But you’re not alone. You’ll continue ECT weekly at the outpatient center. And you have a strong support system."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 42,
      "time": "2172-09-19 09:04:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "My boyfriend’s been great. And my mom helps with the baby."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 43,
      "time": "2172-09-19 09:05:15",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "That’s important. We’ll also set you up with therapy focused on borderline personality traits and coping strategies."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 44,
      "time": "2172-09-20 10:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Your thyroid levels are stable. Any more stomach pain?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 45,
      "time": "2172-09-20 10:01:15",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "A little, but the meds help. I’ve been using my inhaler too—my chest gets tight sometimes."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 46,
      "time": "2172-09-20 10:02:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good. Keep using it as prescribed. Asthma can flare with stress, so managing your mood helps your breathing too."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 47,
      "time": "2172-09-21 09:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Tomorrow’s your last day. You’ll have one more ECT before discharge."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 48,
      "time": "2172-09-21 09:31:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’m nervous about leaving. What if I start feeling that way again?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 49,
      "time": "2172-09-21 09:33:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’ll give you a crisis plan. If thoughts come back, you call your therapist, go to the ED, or call 988. You don’t have to handle it alone."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 50,
      "time": "2172-09-21 09:34:15",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Okay… that helps. I don’t want to end up back here."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 51,
      "time": "2172-09-21 09:35:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "This stay was about stabilization. Now it’s about maintenance. You’ve made real progress."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 52,
      "time": "2172-09-22 08:00:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Good morning. Ready for your final ECT?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 53,
      "time": "2172-09-22 08:01:15",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "As ready as I’ll ever be. I’m glad I did this."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 54,
      "time": "2172-09-22 08:02:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "So are we. You’ve worked hard. After the treatment, we’ll go over your discharge plan."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 55,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:30:00",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You did well today. How’s your head?"
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 56,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:31:15",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Just a little sore. Nothing like the first time."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 57,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:32:30",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Great. Now, for discharge: you’ll continue weekly ECT, see your psychiatrist every two weeks, and start dialectical behavior therapy."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 58,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:34:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "DBT? I’ve heard it helps with emotional control."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 59,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:35:15",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Exactly. It’s especially helpful for borderline personality traits and managing intense emotions."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 60,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:36:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I want to be present for my baby. I don’t want to miss moments."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 61,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:37:45",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "And you will. This is the beginning of that. Keep reaching out. You’re not a burden—you’re someone worth fighting for."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 62,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:39:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you… for not giving up on me."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 63,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:40:15",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Never. Take care of yourself. We’ll see you in follow-up."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 64,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:41:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I will. I promise."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 65,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:42:45",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "One more thing—your allergies are flagged: Reglan, Erythromycin, Effexor, Haldol, Invega. Avoid those."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 66,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:44:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Got it. I’ll tell any new doctors."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 67,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:45:15",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Perfect. You’re all set. Your ride is here. Take it one day at a time."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 68,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:46:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "One day at a time. I can do that."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 69,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:47:45",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "And remember, progress isn’t linear. If you stumble, reach out. That’s strength, not weakness."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 70,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:49:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I’ll try to remember that."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 71,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:50:15",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’ve already shown so much strength. Keep going."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 72,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:51:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you, Doctor."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 73,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:52:45",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’re welcome. Take care."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 74,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:54:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I will."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 75,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:55:15",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re proud of you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 76,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:56:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "That means a lot."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 77,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:57:45",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "It’s true. See you soon."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 78,
      "time": "2172-09-22 13:59:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Bye."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 79,
      "time": "2172-09-22 14:00:15",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "Take care."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 80,
      "time": "2172-09-22 14:01:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I will."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 81,
      "time": "2172-09-22 14:02:45",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "We’re here if you need us."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 82,
      "time": "2172-09-22 14:04:00",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 83,
      "time": "2172-09-22 14:05:15",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You’ve got this."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 84,
      "time": "2172-09-22 14:06:30",
      "speaker": "Patient",
      "text": "I hope so."
    },
    {
      "turn_number": 85,
      "time": "2172-09-22 14:07:45",
      "speaker": "Doctor",
      "text": "You do. See you soon."
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "admission_start": "2172-09-12 19:57:00",
    "admission_end": "2172-09-22 15:20:00",
    "summary_paragraph": "A 30-year-old woman was admitted for psychiatric evaluation after reporting a self-aborted suicide attempt involving accelerating her car without intent to veer off the road. She has a history of bipolar disorder, borderline personality disorder, chronic pain, endometriosis, and prior suicide attempts. She was stabilized on the psychiatry service, with weekly electroconvulsive therapy (ECT) resumed during admission on days 3, 6, and 10. She endorsed passive suicidal ideation but denied active intent by discharge. Her mood improved with treatment, and she engaged in discharge planning, including continuation of ECT and initiation of dialectical behavior therapy. She was discharged home with close outpatient follow-up and a crisis plan.",
    "problems": [
      "Bipolar disorder, unspecified",
      "Hypothyroidism, unspecified",
      "Borderline personality disorder",
      "Endometriosis, unspecified",
      "Gastro-esophageal reflux disease without esophagitis",
      "Unspecified asthma, uncomplicated"
    ]
  }
}
